  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.12.0 adds structured help result context and an opt-in typed projection and custom entry mapping API. Existing help formatters and block output remain the default. The package includes typed command and member metadata and the extensible entry model, remains backed internally by Workes.ContentSystem, and exposes no ContentSystem types publicly. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
